import fs from'node:fs';import assert from'node:assert/strict';import{createHash}from'node:crypto';const sha=b=>createHash('sha256').update(b).digest('hex'),base='docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc',raw=fs.readFileSync('tmp/rust-r4abc/independent/g4-preclose11.json');assert.equal(sha(raw),'5cdc471980b0c1610147c33ea2a60cdec6f15785b80e7a62c02f35a4e5701386');assert.equal(JSON.parse(raw).decision,'Pass');fs.writeFileSync(base+'/g4-preclose11.json.bin',raw,{flag:'wx'});const before=fs.readFileSync('tmp/rust-r4abc/independent/g4-preclose11-live-before.json');fs.writeFileSync(base+'/g4-preclose11-live-before.json.bin',before,{flag:'wx'});fs.writeFileSync(base+'/g4-close-permission71.json',JSON.stringify({kind:'adopted-independent-exact-plan-G4-write-permission',reviewSha256:sha(raw),planSha256:'062404d37afe1f6c490a86720d1faea76f0cba97d08c4e800b759ab46ffd3ef0',closeOnly:[103,104,105,102],keepOpen:[101,57],executionOrder:[103,104,105,102,101,57],authorizedActualApplication:true,actualApplied:false,finalIndependentActualReviewRequired:true,G4Certified:false},null,2)+'\n',{flag:'wx'});console.log(JSON.stringify({precloseAdopted:true,actualApplied:false}));
